          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+spectra"}> model structure on spectra
            ,
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+monoidal+smash+product+of+spectra"} symmetric monoidal smash product of spectra
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %strong> symmetric spectrum
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+symmetric+spectra"} model structure on symmetric spectra
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orthogonal+spectrum"}> orthogonal spectrum
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+orthogonal+spectra"} model structure on orthogonal spectra
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/S-module"}> S-module
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+S-modules"} model structure on S-modules
          %h2#references References
          %p The orginal article is
          %ul
            %li#HoveyShipleySmith00
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Hovey"}> Mark Hovey
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brooke+Shipley"} Brooke Shipley
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeff+Smith"} Jeff Smith
              = succeed "," do
                %em Symmetric spectra
              %strong 13
              (2000) 149-208 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/9801077"}> arXiv:math/9801077
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/S0894-0347-99-00320-3"} doi:10.1090/S0894-0347-99-00320-3
          %p A comprehensive textbook account is in
          %ul
            %li#Schwede12
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Schwede"}> Stefan Schwede
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Symmetric+spectra"} Symmetric spectra
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.uni-bonn.de/~schwede/SymSpec-v3.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Further discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+symmetric+spectra"} model structure on symmetric spectra
            beyond (
            %a{:href => "#HoveyShipleySmith00"}> Hovey-Shipley-Smith 00
            ) and
            %a{:href => "#Schwede12"} Schwede 12, part III
            includes
          %ul
            %li#MandellMaySchwedeShipley01
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Mandell"}> Michael Mandell
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"} Peter May
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Schwede"} Stefan Schwede
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brooke+Shipley"} Brooke Shipley
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Model+categories+of+diagram+spectra"} Model categories of diagram spectra
              = succeed ")" do
